{"id":"506be2cdd56dc40d","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-comp-kleene-t-predicate.md","title":"ZFC Comp Kleene T Predicate","display":"df-zfc-comp-kleene-t-predicate — ZFC Comp Kleene T Predicate","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-comp-kleene-t-predicate","aliases":["58-df-zfc-comp-kleene-t-predicate"],"display":"df-zfc-comp-kleene-t-predicate — ZFC Comp Kleene T Predicate","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-omega]]","[[58-df-relation]]","[[58-df-godel-numbering]]","[[58-df-zfc-comp-computation-run]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-comp-kleene-t-predicate"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-comp-kleene-t-predicate</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-comp-kleene-t-predicate — ZFC Comp Kleene T Predicate"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"58-df-omega\">58-df-omega</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7ccfc8c88f29968a\" href=\"?note=7ccfc8c88f29968a\" title=\"58-df-relation\">58-df-relation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a2b0a7eb56fecb6a\" href=\"?note=a2b0a7eb56fecb6a\" title=\"58-df-godel-numbering\">58-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f2803e07105244cf\" href=\"?note=f2803e07105244cf\" title=\"58-df-zfc-comp-computation-run\">58-df-zfc-comp-computation-run</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,x,t\\in\\omega\">\\(e,x,t\\in\\omega\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,r\\in V\">\\(M,r\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCompComputationRun}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCompComputationRun}_S\\)</span> (computation-run predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f2803e07105244cf\" href=\"?note=f2803e07105244cf\" title=\"58-df-zfc-comp-computation-run\">58-df-zfc-comp-computation-run</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\\)</span> (Gödel coding, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a2b0a7eb56fecb6a\" href=\"?note=a2b0a7eb56fecb6a\" title=\"58-df-godel-numbering\">58-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HaltConf}(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{HaltConf}(M)\\)</span> (halting configurations induced by the machine code <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCompKleeneTPredicate}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCompKleeneTPredicate}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comp\\text{-}kleene\\text{-}t\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCompKleeneTPredicate}_S(e,x,t)\\leftrightarrow e,x,t\\in\\omega\\land\\exists M,r\\in V\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(e=\\ulcorner M\\urcorner\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCompComputationRun}_S(r,M,x)\\land r(n)\\in\\mathrm{HaltConf}(M)\\land t=\\ulcorner r\\upharpoonright(n+1)\\urcorner\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comp\\text{-}kleene\\text{-}t\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCompKleeneTPredicate}_S(e,x,t)\\leftrightarrow e,x,t\\in\\omega\\land\\exists M,r\\in V\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(e=\\ulcorner M\\urcorner\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCompComputationRun}_S(r,M,x)\\land r(n)\\in\\mathrm{HaltConf}(M)\\land t=\\ulcorner r\\upharpoonright(n+1)\\urcorner\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> now codes a concrete finite initial segment of a correctly initialized run of the machine coded by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span>, ending in a halting configuration.</li>\n<li>The former <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CodesHaltingRun}\">\\(\\operatorname{CodesHaltingRun}\\)</span> symbol had no definition or dependency source.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-omega]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-relation","status":"resolved","id":"7ccfc8c88f29968a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"a2b0a7eb56fecb6a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-comp-computation-run","status":"resolved","id":"f2803e07105244cf","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · d